      "message": "The main function required by `DiceClearMemory` — `flushed_zeroize` — is in vmbase. I don’t think we should move it to a DICE-specific library. I agree that things appear a bit entangled here. Perhaps it would be more clear to keep pvmfw as it is and simply add the same `DiceClearMemory` to rialto?",
